 laces three full-time fellows inside federal research agencies such as the
  NSF or DOE for one year\, after a pre-service residency at FAS.\n\nOrgani
 sation: Federation of American Scientists (FAS)\nLocation: Washington\, DC
  area\, United States. Full-time and mostly in person at agency offices.\n
 Award: USD 174\,000 per year\, prorated monthly\, plus USD 1\,500 for trav
 el and USD 1\,500 for professional development. Fellows are not eligible f
 or employer-sponsored benefits\; the salary is expected to cover health an
 d living costs. No application fee.\nDuration: One year at a federal agenc
 y (extension possible)\, preceded by a residency at FAS\; start no later t
 han 4 January 2027.\n\nMore: https://fas.org/career/metascience-fellowship
 /?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
