 esearch areas include data science\, AI and society\; privacy and security
 \; and platforms and digital infrastructure.\n\nOrganisation: Princeton Un
 iversity\, Center for Information Technology Policy (CITP)\nLocation: Prin
 ceton\, New Jersey\, USA. In person.\nAward: Fully funded positions (salar
 y not stated). No application fee.\nDuration: 12 months from about 1 Septe
 mber 2027\, renewable for a second year\n\nMore: https://blog.citp.princet
 on.edu/2026/11/03/2027-28-fellows-applications-are-now-open/?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
